    {
      "type": "story",
      "items": [
        "The old man said, 'I need a tiger coat. So I will hunt for a tiger.'"
      ],
      "audioPaths": [
        "audio/lesson-50_c5_i0_the-old-man-said-i-n.mp3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "story",
      "items": [
        "The girl said, 'But you can not see. How can you hunt for a tiger?'"
      ],
      "audioPaths": [
        "audio/lesson-50_c6_i0_the-girl-said-but-yo.mp3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "story",
      "items": [
        "The old man said, 'I can hear. Tigers make sounds. I will hear those sounds and take a shot.'"
      ],
      "audioPaths": [
        "audio/lesson-50_c7_i0_the-old-man-said-i-c.mp3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "story",
      "items": [
        "The girl said, 'The shot may miss.'"
      ],
      "audioPaths": [
        "audio/lesson-50_c8_i0_the-girl-said-the-sh.mp3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "story",
      "items": [
        "'No,' the old man said. 'When I hear something I will take a good shot.'"
      ],
      "audioPaths": [
        "audio/lesson-50_c9_i0_no-the-old-man-said-.mp3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "story",
      "items": [
        "So the man went out with his gun. He did not see well. So he fell over a log. Then he fell over a rock."
      ],
      "audioPaths": [
        "audio/lesson-50_c10_i0_so-the-man-went-out-.mp3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "story",
      "items": [
        "Then he walked up a hill. When he got to the top he stopped. 'I hear something,' he said. 'I have found a tiger.'"
      ],
      "audioPaths": [
        "audio/lesson-50_c11_i0_then-he-walked-up-a-.mp3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "story",
      "items": [
        "The man did hear the sound of a tiger. It was a big tiger. And it was very near. The old man picked up his gun. 'Blam.'"
      ],
      "audioPaths": [
        "audio/lesson-50_c12_i0_the-man-did-hear-the.mp3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "story",
      "items": [
        "The shot did not hit the tiger. It hit a nut in a tree. The nut fell on a mouse."
      ],
      "audioPaths": [
        "audio/lesson-50_c13_i0_the-shot-did-not-hit.mp3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "story",
      "items": [
        "The mouse yelled, 'Stop hitting me with nuts.'"
      ],
      "audioPaths": [
        "audio/lesson-50_c14_i0_the-mouse-yelled-sto.mp3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "story",
      "items": [
        "This Is Not the End."
      ],
      "audioPaths": [
        "audio/lesson-50_c15_i0_this-is-not-the-end.mp3"
      ]
    }
  ]
}